<section>
  <h1>Support</h1>
  <p>The support matrix is the single authority for what each harness really supports; this page quotes its opening paragraph verbatim and links to the matrix instead of copying it, so the site never adds a support claim of its own.</p>
  <blockquote>
    <p>The maintained agent-harness set is <strong>Codex, Claude Code, MiMo Code (<code>mimo</code>), DeepSeek Harness (<code>dsh</code>), and zcode</strong>. All other harnesses, including Pi and Kimi Code, are unsupported by this project. A portable package may remain readable elsewhere, but that is not a support commitment. This matrix separates shared package behavior from host integration evidence: discovery, invocation, hooks, memory APIs, and optional integrations.</p>
  </blockquote>
  <p>Deep links: <a href="https://github.com/TeFuirnever/azhou-ai-hub/blob/main/docs/support-matrix.md">Support matrix</a> · <a href="https://github.com/TeFuirnever/azhou-ai-hub/blob/main/docs/skill-platform-view.md">Per-skill platform view</a></p>
